TI  - A 51-Year-Old Man With a Large Posterior Mediastinal Mass.
PG  - e357-e363
LID - S0012-3692(21)00869-2 [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.chest.2021.04.058 [doi]
AB  - A 51-year-old White male never-smoker presented with intermittent cough and 
      progressive dyspnea. His symptoms started after an exposure to bat guano while 
      cleaning his attic approximately 9 months earlier. He has received several 
      courses of antibiotic and corticosteroid for these symptoms, with short-term 
      relief.
