AB  - A 45-year-old Japanese man underwent wisdom tooth extraction. He developed right 
      chest pain 2 days later, followed by continuous fever with dyspnea 2 weeks after 
      the tooth extraction, and then came to our hospital. He complained of cough and 
      purulent sputum.
