PG  - e217-e223
LID - S0012-3692(21)00663-2 [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.chest.2021.03.050 [doi]
AB  - A 35-year-old woman without past medical history sought treatment for fatigue and 
      dry cough of 3 weeks' duration. Basic laboratory tests revealed severe anemia. 
      She had no history of bleeding, hemoptysis, dyspnea, or fever. The patient was 
      admitted for RBC transfusion and more extensive diagnostics.
