TI  - Clinical and Imaging Features of COVID-19 in a Neonate.
PG  - e5-e7
LID - S0012-3692(20)30533-X [pii]
LID - 10.1016/j.chest.2020.03.018 [doi]
AB  - We report the clinical history, laboratory findings, and imaging features of 
      coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) in a neonate whose mother was also a patient. 
      The newborn was the youngest patient with COVID-19 in the world at the time he 
      was diagnosed. This case has brought more attention and understanding to the 
      epidemic and mode of transmission of the disease.
